WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:06.256
Hello?

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.093
What? The boss is coming? What time?

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:25.442
Before the boss arrives,
I've got a job for ya.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:28.862
Everyone seems to think
you're the man, but…

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:29.988
SWOOSH

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:33.158
…you've still gotta prove it to me.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:34.200
BEEP

00:00:34.284 --> 00:00:36.453
Are you up to it? Huh?

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:48.757
SWIPE

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:51.217
Not bad.

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:53.928
This is your turf now.

00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:58.600
Hey, attack the goddamned corners!

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:03.730
That's where all the scum hangs out,
so hit it, you piece of chickenshit!

